{"candidateAnswer":"Their experiences likely lead them to become more cautious and risk-averse. They both have adopted stricter routines, indicating a disciplined approach to managing stress and challenges.","evidence":"[D9:1 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! Exciting news: I started a new diet and exercise routine last Monday and it's made a huge difference. I feel great! What about you, what changes have you made recently?\n[D4:4 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: That's great, Sam! I struggled with my health a few years ago, but stuck with it. Here's a reminder of my commitment - my gym membership card. It's not just about exercise, diet and lifestyle changes also play a big role.\n[D4:6 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: I made some dietary changes, like cutting down on sugary snacks and eating more veggies and fruit, and it made a big impact on my health. Have you considered any changes?","itemId":"urn:uuid:42a382cd-bdbc-5b88-aa5a-ca3efadade24","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:110a6d40c6656f88d915d995e7136339f7d45eecff6ab7894fa23f3a4ec7166d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How might Evan and Sam's experiences with health and lifestyle changes influence their approach to stress and challenges?","referenceAnswer":"Their experiences likely lead them to view challenges as opportunities for growth and change. They both have embraced healthier lifestyles, indicating a proactive approach to managing stress and challenges.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"110a6d40c6656f88d915d995e7136339f7d45eecff6ab7894fa23f3a4ec7166d"}}]}